\"bb_ul\"><li>Free Mode [1-10 Players]<br>Play Official and Workshop Levels, earn medals and climb the leaderboards! <br>The game will automatically match you up with other players playing the same level, so you can compare your times in a non-competitive environment.<br></li><li>Arcade Mode [1 Player]<br>Complete random levels without crashing before the time runs out. <br>You have 3 lives per level. The time limit will be reduced with every completed level.<br>The more levels you complete in a run, the more XP you will earn.<br></li><li>Competitive Mode [2-5 Players]<br>Play against other players of similar skill level and climb the rankings!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leaderboards</h2>Every level, official and from the workshop, supports leaderboards where players can compete for the best time! <br>You can compare your times with friends too!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ship Customization</h2>Combine parts to create your own unique space ship! Play the game and level up to unlock more parts!",
